 is the character home you have been waiting for! This 1938 bungalow is situated in the historic community of Westmount. This home has a very private, zen like garden/yard area. The attached single car garage is unheard of and lends itself to something out of a movie (you will understand when you see it in person) There is a large living room leading to a bright dining area. Hardwood floors throughout the main floor lend to this homes charm. We have 2 bedrooms on the main floor with custom built in closets, main floor bath was renovated and keeps the integrity and overall feel of this home. Wooden cabinets accentuate the kitchen and add to the homes appeal. We have another bedroom and artist studio in the basement, as well as access to the garage and a living room space. This home has been lovingly cared for and needs the next owner to give it some more love and attention and restore it to it's original grandeur. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$367,500"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","3"],["Bathrooms","1"],["Living area","910 sq ft"],["Lot size","4,370 sq ft"],["Year built","1938"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Westmount"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5M2E3"],["MLS® number","E4502024"],["Listed","August 4, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Dryer"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Partially finished, Full"],["Parking","Attached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level",""],["Dining room","Main level",""],["Kitchen","Main level",""],["Den","Basement",""],["Primary Bedroom","Main level",""],["Bedroom 2","Main level",""],["Bedroom 3","Lower level",""]],"courtesy":"Cory Clendenning, Royal LePage Noralta Real Estate","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"westmount","area":"central-edmonton"}